    "details": {
      "eyebrow": "Product details",
      "heading": "Everything that's in it.",
      "body": "Mandatory information under EU Cosmetics Regulation 1223/2009 and German price-indication law.",
      "net_content": "Net content",
      "base_price": "Base price",
      "availability": "Availability",
      "item_1_title": "Ingredients (INCI)",
      "item_1_body_html": "<p>Aqua, Mineral Oil, Allantoin, Calcium Thioglycolate, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Juice, Chrysanthellum Indicum Flower Water, Sodium Hydroxide, Butylene Glycol, Glycerin, Larrea Divaricata Extract, Lecithin, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Parfum, Phenoxyethanol, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Ethylhexylglycerin</p><p>Listed in descending order of weight, identical to the packaging.</p>",
      "item_2_title": "How to use",
      "item_2_body_html": "<p>24 hours before first use, do a patch test on a small area inside the elbow.</p><p>Clean and dry the skin, remove any cosmetic residue. Shake the bottle well. Spray onto dry, unbroken skin until the hairs are covered. Do not rub in. We recommend disposable gloves for spreading and wiping.</p><p>Leave on for 8 minutes, up to 17 minutes for coarse hair – never longer. Then wipe off with a damp cloth and rinse thoroughly with lukewarm water. Do not use soap immediately afterwards; pat the skin dry.</p>",
      "item_3_title": "Warnings",
      "item_3_body_html": "<p><strong>Contains thioglycolate. Follow the instructions. Keep out of reach of children.</strong></p><p>Do not use on the face, the intimate area, mucous membranes or on irritated, broken or sunburnt skin. Do not use if you are hypersensitive to any ingredient. Avoid contact with eyes – rinse thoroughly with water immediately on contact. Do not use directly before or after shaving, waxing or sunbathing. If redness or burning persists, rinse off immediately and stop using. Do not exceed the recommended time.</p>",
      "item_4_title": "Responsible person & manufacturer",
      "item_4_body_html": "<p>Responsible person under Art. 4 of Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009:<br>MH Solutions – Petrina Angelova<br>Riegerweg 34<br>82024 Taufkirchen<br>Germany</p><p>Made in: China<br>Product enquiries: hello@my-haut.com</p>",
      "item_5_title": "Durability & batch number",
      "item_5_body_html": "<p>Best before and batch number: see the print on the bottle.</p><p>The period-after-opening (PAO) figure is not yet fixed and will be added here once it is.</p><p>Store cool, dry and out of direct sunlight.</p>",
      "item_6_title": "Safety assessment (CPSR)",
      "item_6_body_html": "<p>MyHaut has a cosmetic product safety report (CPSR) under Annex I of Regulation (EC) No 1223/2009, the product information file is maintained and the product is notified in the EU CPNP portal.</p>"
    },
    "faq": {
      "eyebrow": "FAQ",
      "heading": "Still have questions?",
      "body_html": "Write to <a href=\"mailto:support@my-haut.com\">support@my-haut.com</a> – we reply within 48 hours.",
      "q_1": "How fast will I get MyHaut?",
      "a_1": "We ship from Germany with DHL, usually the next working day. Delivery takes 2–5 working days. You receive the tracking number by email.",
      "q_2": "How long does one bottle last?",
      "a_2": "One bottle holds 100 ml – enough for about 4 applications on arms or lower legs, or about 2 full-body applications. Smaller areas such as underarms go further.",
      "q_3": "Which body areas is the spray suitable for?",
      "a_3": "Legs, arms, underarms, chest and back. Do not use on the face, the intimate area, mucous membranes or on irritated, broken or sunburnt skin.",
      "q_4": "How long does the skin stay smooth?",
      "a_4": "That depends on your hair type. In our own user tests the skin stayed smooth for 2 to 7 days. Because the hair is dissolved right at the skin surface, it grows back soft, not stubbly like after shaving.",
      "q_5": "Is it suitable for sensitive skin?",
      "a_5": "Aloe vera and allantoin are in the formula for exactly that. Still do a patch test inside the elbow 24 hours before. If it burns or stays red, rinse off immediately.",
      "q_6": "Does the spray smell like other hair removal creams?",
      "a_6": "The formula has none of the typical sharp smell – you notice a light, neutral scent.",
      "q_7": "How is it different from a hair removal cream?",
      "a_7": "The principle is similar, the application is not: you spray instead of spreading, need no spatula, and aloe vera plus allantoin care for the skin while it works.",
      "q_8": "Can I return MyHaut?",
      "a_8": "Yes – unopened bottles in undamaged original packaging can be returned within 30 days of delivery, and we refund the price of those bottles. Opened bottles cannot be returned for hygiene reasons. Our tip: start with one bottle and the patch test. Your statutory 14-day right of withdrawal applies regardless."
    },
